        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;padding:6cqw;border-radius:5cqw;background:#F4F0FB;border:.7cqw solid #C6B9E4;border-bottom:1.7cqw solid #6653A3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2.5cqw;color:#31265B;overflow:hidden'><div style='flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:3cqw'><div style='font:700 6cqw/1.1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6653A3'>Study guide</div><div style='flex:none;width:11cqw;height:11cqw'><svg viewBox='0 0 64 64' style='width:100%;height:100%;display:block' aria-hidden='true'><g fill='none' stroke='#6653A3' stroke-width='4.5' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M22 42c-5-4-8-9-8-15a18 18 0 0 1 36 0c0 6-3 11-8 15-2 2-3 4-3 7H25c0-3-1-5-3-7z'/><path d='M26 56h12'/><path d='M28 49h8'/></g></svg></div></div><div style='flex:none;font:700 11cqw/1.1 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden'>Name the topic</div><div style='flex:1 1 0;min-height:0;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5cqw'><div style='display:flex;height:4cqw;border-radius:9cqw;overflow:hidden;background:#e2e8f0'><div style='flex:1 0 0;background:#15803d'></div><div style='flex:1 0 0;background:#f59e0b'></div></div><div style='font:700 6.5cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#334155'>1 of 2 concepts solid</div><div style='font:700 6.5cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#6653A3'>Start with A concept built on it</div><div style='align-self:flex-start;padding:.8cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:9cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:700 6cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase'>1 to check</div></div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The Summary: the study guide as a card, with its progress bar. The Method writes it too.",
